    "content": "## Scope\nMaster index for the **150-question Tosca SME Architect** bank. Answers follow the Tosca SME Interview Q&A structure and emphasize **Tricentis Tosca documentation** concepts (Modules, ExecutionLists, DEX/AOS, TCD/TDM, engines).\n\n\n## Visual overview\nAuto-generated from this lesson’s **title, tags, and headings** — refresh anytime with `npm run hub:diagrams`.\n\n### Process flowchart\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  Start[TOSCA] --> N0[Priority map]\n  N0 --> N1[Answer format every question]\n  N1 --> N2[Study path]\n```\n\n### Topic mindmap\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((Tosca SME Architect interview bank 150 e))\n    Tosca\n    SME\n    SAP\n    Data Integrity\n    Mobile\n    DEX\n    Practice\n      Checklist\n      Failure modes\n```\n\n\n## Priority map\n| Priority | Cluster | Questions |\n|---|---|---|\n| High | Tosca SME Q&A: Model-based automation architecture & frameworks | 15 |\n| High | Tosca SME Q&A: Data Integrity (DI) & reconciliation | 15 |\n| High | Tosca SME Q&A: Mobile automation strategy (iOS/Android) | 15 |\n| High | Tosca SME Q&A: DEX, Tosca Server, TDS & multi-user governance | 15 |\n| High | Tosca SME Q&A: CI/CD & DevSecOps integration | 15 |\n| High | Tosca SME Q&A: SAP ECC, S/4HANA & Fiori automation | 20 |\n| High | Tosca SME Q&A: API, RTBs, Vision AI & custom Modules | 15 |\n| High | Tosca SME Q&A: TDM, TCD & regression optimization | 15 |\n| High | Tosca SME Q&A: Leadership, mentoring & automation ROI | 10 |\n| High | Tosca SME Q&A: Open-source comparison, scripting & certifications | 15 |\n\n## Answer format (every question)\n1. **Syntax Example**\n2. **Expert Pointers (SME Insights)**\n3. **Tricky Issues & Fixes**\n4. **Best Practices**\n\nMinimum **10 pointers** per question across sections 2–4.\n\n## Study path\n1. Architecture & DI & Mobile first (role differentiators).\n2. DEX/TDS + CI/CD next (infrastructure).\n3. SAP ECC/S4/Fiori deep dive.\n4. Leadership/ROI + certifications for closing rounds.\n",
