    "content": "## Scope\nATS-oriented **technical-only** keyword map for AI Engineer / AI Architect / LLMOps profiles. Healthcare and soft-skill banks are intentionally excluded.\n\n\n## Visual overview\nAI Architect path across GenAI tutorials.\n\n### Process flowchart\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  Data[Data / RAG] --> Agent[Orchestration]\n  Agent --> Serve[Serve / observe]\n  Serve --> Gov[Governance]\n```\n\n### Topic mindmap\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((GenAI))\n    Build\n    Run\n    Trust\n    Lead\n```\n\n\n## Cluster → LearnHub coverage\n| Cluster | Example keywords | LearnHub path |\n|---|---|---|\n| Languages | Python, C++, Go, Rust, TypeScript, Java | Programming Q&A: Languages for AI systems |\n| Core CS | Algorithms, Concurrency, Performance Tuning | Programming Q&A: Algorithms… |\n| APIs & design | REST, GraphQL, Microservices, Design Patterns | Programming Q&A: APIs… |\n| Git & delivery | Git, GitHub, Code Reviews, CI/CD | Programming Q&A: Git… |\n| MCP | Model Context Protocol, MCP Tools | AI Q&A: MCP… |\n| RL | Q-Learning, Policy Gradient, Actor-Critic | AI Q&A: Reinforcement learning… |\n| Generative | GANs, VAEs, Diffusion | AI Q&A: Generative models… |\n| Perception | OpenCV, ASR, TTS, spaCy | AI Q&A: Computer vision… |\n| Verification | Golden references, Deterministic Verification | AI Q&A: Deterministic verification… |\n| Edge/AutoML | Federated Learning, Edge AI, AutoML | AI Q&A: Federated learning… |\n| Frameworks | PyTorch, TensorFlow, ONNX, sklearn | Tools Q&A: PyTorch… |\n| Scale train/serve | Triton, DeepSpeed, Accelerate | Tools Q&A: Triton… |\n| Streaming | Kafka, Flink, Hadoop | Tools Q&A: Kafka… |\n| Eval tooling | Ragas, Outlines, OpenAI APIs | Tools Q&A: Ragas… |\n| Features/graphs | Feast, Neo4j | Tools Q&A: Feast… |\n| Observability | OTel, Prometheus, Grafana, Datadog | Cloud Q&A: Observability… |\n| Edge traffic | Istio, API Gateway, CDN, Cache | Cloud Q&A: Service mesh… |\n| Distributed theory | CAP, CQRS, Chaos | Cloud Q&A: Distributed systems… |\n| Testing | TDD, BDD, Load/Security testing | Engineering Q&A: TDD… |\n| Rollouts | Canary, Feature Flags, Vault | MLOps Q&A: Canary… |\n| XAI | SHAP, LIME, Fairness, Adversarial ML | MLOps Q&A: Explainable AI… |\n| Data platform | Mesh, Lineage, Avro, ORC | Data Q&A: Mesh… |\n| Accelerators | GPU/TPU, Slurm, K8s RBAC | Infra Q&A: GPU/TPU… |\n| Already on site | LangChain, RAG, Bedrock, K8s/Terraform, MLflow… | Existing GenAI/ML/DevOps/Data Q&As |\n\n## Extended keyword checklist (paste-friendly)\n```\nC++, Python, Java, Go, TypeScript, Rust, Scala, Kotlin, R, Julia, Bash, PowerShell,\nAlgorithms, Data Structures, Multithreading, Concurrency, Memory Management, HPC,\nREST, GraphQL, Microservices, Design Patterns, Clean Code, Git, CI/CD,\nArtificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Reinforcement Learning,\nMCP, Transformers, LLMs, Embeddings, RAG, Prompt Engineering, Guardrails, Agentic AI,\nModel Registry, Drift Detection, A/B Testing, AutoML, Federated Learning, Edge AI,\nComputer Vision, NLP, Speech Recognition, TTS, GANs, VAEs, Diffusion Models,\nLangChain, LlamaIndex, LangGraph, Hugging Face, MLflow, BentoML, Ray, FastAPI,\nPyTorch, TensorFlow, Keras, Scikit-Learn, ONNX, Triton, DeepSpeed, Accelerate,\nKafka, Flink, Airflow, Prefect, Spark, Feast, Neo4j, Ragas, Outlines,\nAWS, SageMaker, Bedrock, Azure ML, Vertex AI, Kubernetes, Docker, Terraform, GitOps,\nPrometheus, Grafana, OpenTelemetry, Jaeger, Istio, Vault,\nTDD, BDD, Chaos Engineering, CAP Theorem, CQRS, DDD,\nCanary, Blue-Green, Feature Flags, SHAP, LIME, Data Mesh, Data Lineage, Slurm\n```\n\n## How to use\n1. Pick a cluster Q&A and rehearse answers in 40–60 seconds.\n2. Mirror the same keywords in your resume **only where you have proof** (projects, metrics).\n3. Prefer LearnHub tutorials over keyword stuffing — depth beats density in interviews.\n",
