    "content": "## Scope\nUse this page as a **bridge between Teradata tutorials**. Diagrams are Mermaid (free, open-source) rendered in the browser — no paid mindmap SaaS.\n\n## Learning path flowchart\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  A[Architecture PE/AMP/BYNET] --> B[Physical design PI/PPI]\n  B --> C[Load utilities TPT]\n  C --> D[TASM workloads]\n  D --> E[DBQL + Viewpoint]\n  E --> F[Performance tuning]\n  F --> G[Security + DR]\n  G --> H[Cloud migration]\n  H --> I[Leadership / BFSI ops]\n```\n\n## Topic mindmap\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((Teradata Lead path))\n    Core platform\n      AMP PE BYNET\n      VantageCloud\n      TPT loads\n      PI PPI JI\n    Workload\n      TASM\n      Throttles\n      Events SLA\n    Evidence\n      DBQL\n      Viewpoint\n      ResUsage AWT\n    Enterprise\n      Security\n      DR HA\n      Cloud\n      Banking 24x7\n```\n\n## How to use\nOpen linked Q&A tutorials in order along the flowchart. Each tutorial also embeds its own flowchart + mindmap under **Visual overview**.\n",
